text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; =
text-decoration-color: initial;">I would like to create a v14 elevation =
simulator based on the gold standard v.10.4, with some upgrades =
conceptually found in attached v12.&nbsp; But v.12 is quite buggy and I =
mostly don=E2=80=99t like it. &nbsp; Codex, your job, if you choose to =
accept it, is to take what is good from somebody else=E2=80=99s code in =
v10.4, leave alone the tabs that are unaffected by the integration of =
the new PDO/ENSO connections and the policy levers, and upgrade it as =
described below. &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=3D"font-size: 16px; =
color: rgb(39, 37, 30); font-family: pplxSans, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, =
-apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica =
