pre-line; background-color: rgba(39, 26, 0, 0.035); =
text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; =
text-decoration-color: initial;">This will require you in the planning =
phase to deeply analyze and critique each of the technical assertions =
embedded mathematically in the code, described in the text and displayed =
graphically. &nbsp;(and check for self consistency) If satisfied, =
proceed with planning the next version. If concerned, itemize each =
inconsistency or falsehood and let=E2=80=99s =
talk.</span></div><div><span style=3D"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(39, =
37, 30); font-family: pplxSans, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, =
system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, =
Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans&quot;, &quot;Yu =
Gothic&quot;, Meiryo, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft =
YaHei&quot;, &quot;PingFang TC&quot;, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, =
&quot;PingFang HK&quot;, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, &quot;PingFang =
MO&quot;, &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, &quot;Apple SD Gothic =
Neo&quot;, &quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color =
Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, =
&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: =
2; widows: 2; white-space: pre-line; background-color: rgba(39, 26, 0, =
0.035); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: =
initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><br></span></div><div><span =
style=3D"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(39, 37, 30); font-family: pplxSans, =
ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe =
