pre-line; background-color: rgba(39, 26, 0, 0.035); =
text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; =
text-decoration-color: initial;">Note that I am fond of the current =
styling of v10.4, its presentation and its graphics, especially how it =
compares the Tarboton stochastic analysis to the determinative =
prediction. &nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=3D"font-size: 16px; =
color: rgb(39, 37, 30); font-family: pplxSans, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, =
-apple-system, system-ui, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica =
