text-decoration-color: initial;">On the Overview tab, I change the =
sliders and nothing changes on the graph.&nbsp; does it work?&nbsp; I =
would also like the graph to begin at 1977 for context.&nbsp; The intent =
was that this should be a simplified version of the main simulator&nbsp; =
 On the simulator tab I like the graphical presentation of v10.4, =
particularly becasue of the uncertainty cone surrounding the =
projection.&nbsp; On V12, again, I don=E2=80=99t see that any of the =
policy levers actually have an effect on the projection, either from the =
slider or from the annual accounting tabs.&nbsp; Please verify that =
these are working, and if they are, please implement the v12 annual =
accounting (and the new PDO-ENSO correlation) into the v10.4 =
visualization.  On the Cross-validation tab, this tab name applies to =
the V10.4, which we will keep.&nbsp; The v12 cross validation tab will =
be retained in v14 but renamed as =E2=80=9CTesting Hypotheses=E2=80=9D.&nb=
sp; NOTE here that the table in this tab indicates 61% skill for =
forecasting in the five year horizon.&nbsp; We want to forecast out to =
the 2036 horizon and let the uncertainty cone expand =
accordingly.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=3D"font-size: 16px; =
